_:Bdf37265bd5a4ee99bbab13450f33d05a a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AllDisjointClasses>;
                                    <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#members> (ioc:Location
                                                                             <https://standards.buildingsmart.org/IFC/DEV/IFC4/ADD2_TC1/OWL#IfcSpace>
